data: {"id": "e7c9d917627044e9-thinking-parallel_evidence-2214", "run_id": "e7c9d917627044e9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有的真实工具结果，整理关键证据如下：\n\n### 1. Pod 身份与状态（Kubernetes）\n- **实体**: `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` (UID: `b1c01c93...`)\n- **Phase**: `Running`。\n- **Conditions**: `Ready=False`, `ContainersReady=False`。\n- **Container Status (app)**: `ready=False`, `restarts=13`, `reason=CrashLoopBackOff`。\n- **Message**: `back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app`。\n- **Liveness Probe**: `Failed` (HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 500)。\n- **Exit Code**: 容器最后一次退出码为 **137** (OOMKilled / SIGKILL)。\n\n**事实**: P", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788468008684, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

